$ =====================================================================
$ RBE3 TEST SERIES -- Deck 11: independent-grid rotation component
$ silently ignored (a third, separate bug/gap from the two
$ weight-indexing bugs in Decks 02/03/10).
$
$ Grids 501, 502 sit COLLINEAR along the local x-axis (y=z=0 for
$ both), so their translations carry NO information about twist
$ (rotation) about that axis. NASTRAN's own RBE3 documentation
$ explicitly recommends adding a rotation component to one
$ independent grid in exactly this situation, to define that rigid-
$ body mode. Grid 503 does that here: it contributes ONLY comp 4
$ (Rx) to the independent set, weight=5.0, with a prescribed
$ rotation of 0.5 via SPC.
$
$ REFC=14 -- T1 and R1 of the reference grid are both dependent.
$ (T1 is included only so the model has SOME translation-dependent
$ component; T1's own equation does not couple to R1 in this
$ formulation, so it doesn't affect what's being tested.)
$
$ Per NASTRAN's documented technique, grid 503's prescribed rotation
$ is the ONLY source of information about twist on this collinear
$ axis, and should be recovered directly at the reference grid.
$
$ Expected (correct formulation), grid 500:
$   T1 = 0.3   (simple weighted average of grids 501, 502: (0.2+0.4)/2)
$   R1 = 0.5   (recovering independent grid 503's prescribed rotation)
$
$ A solver that ignores independent-grid rotation components (Ci=4/5/6)
$ entirely would instead give R1 = 0.0, discarding grid 503's input
$ no matter what value is prescribed there.
$ =====================================================================
SOL 101
CEND
DISP = ALL
SPC = 1
BEGIN BULK
$
GRID,500,,0.,0.,0.
$
$ Collinear independent translation grids (along x).
GRID,501,,-3.,0.,0.
GRID,502,,3.,0.,0.
$
$ Stabilizing independent grid: contributes ONLY its Rx rotation.
GRID,503,,1.,0.,0.
$
$ Dummy grids + harmless CROD so the model isn't entirely empty.
$ (400 fixed, 401 left free -- MSC Nastran rejects a model with no
$ free DOF at all: "NO L-SET REMAINS AFTER CONSTRAINTS AND O-SET
$ REMOVED.")
GRID,400,,5.,5.,5.
GRID,401,,6.,5.,5.
MAT1,1,1.,,0.
PROD,1,1,1.
CROD,96,1,400,401
$
$ REFC=14: T1 and Rx of grid 500 are dependent.
$ Group 1: grids 501,502, comp=123 (translations), weight=1.0.
$ Group 2: grid 503, comp=4 (rotation), weight=5.0 -- the
$ NASTRAN-recommended stabilizing DOF for a collinear independent set.
RBE3    30              500     14      1.0     123     501     502     +A1
+A1     5.0     4       503
$
$ Collinear grids: translations prescribed, other comps pinned.
SPC,1,501,1,0.2
SPC,1,501,23456,0.
SPC,1,502,1,0.4
SPC,1,502,23456,0.
$
$ Stabilizing grid: prescribe Rx=0.5, pin everything else.
SPC,1,503,123,0.
SPC,1,503,4,0.5
SPC,1,503,56,0.
$
$ Reference grid: only T1, Rx (comps 1,4) are dependent -- fix the rest.
SPC,1,500,2356,0.
$
SPC,1,400,123456,0.
$
ENDDATA
